ent-WGCavernShadeAsclepiu = sinkhole
    .desc = The ground has slumped into a wet limestone shaft. Water drips somewhere below.
ent-WGCavernShadeFervidus = skylight
    .desc = A hole in the roof of a lava tube. Heat shimmers up out of the dark.
ent-WGCavernShadeMerak = sand funnel
    .desc = Sand pours in a slow trickle down a funnel into the cool dark below.
ent-WGCavernShadeAerumna = rift
    .desc = A narrow crack in the chromite, black all the way down.
ent-WGCavernShadeThrascias = moulin
    .desc = Meltwater has bored a round shaft through the ice.
ent-WGCavernShadeCarcinoma = throat
    .desc = The flesh parts around a wet, ribbed opening that swallows the light.

ent-WGCavernStairsAsclepiu = earth steps
    .desc = Roots and packed earth make a rough stair up to the surface.
ent-WGCavernStairsFervidus = basalt steps
    .desc = Cooled lava has set into a rough stair up the side of the shaft.
ent-WGCavernStairsMerak = sandstone steps
    .desc = Steps cut into the sandstone lead up to the surface.
ent-WGCavernStairsAerumna = chromite steps
    .desc = Broken ledges of chromite make a stair up the wall of the rift.
ent-WGCavernStairsThrascias = ice steps
    .desc = Steps cut into the ice lead up the side of the moulin.
ent-WGCavernStairsCarcinoma = flesh ridges
    .desc = Thick ridges of flesh run up the throat like steps.

ent-WGCavernStairs = cavern stairs
    .desc = Steel stairs bolted to the cavern floor, climbing up through the rock overhead.

ent-WGCavernGlowworms = glow-worms
    .desc = A colony of glow-worms hangs from the ceiling, dangling sticky threads that shine a soft green.
ent-WGCavernGutGlow = glowing membrane
    .desc = A patch of the stomach wall pulses with a faint red light.

ent-WGCavernGlowcaps = glowcaps
    .desc = A cluster of pale mushrooms whose caps glow a cold cyan-green in the damp.
ent-WGCavernEmberLichen = ember lichen
    .desc = Shelf lichen that soaks up the magma's heat and gives it back as a dull ember glow.
ent-WGCavernLampAgave = lamp agave
    .desc = A squat desert succulent. Its leaves hold a warm amber phosphorescence.
ent-WGCavernShadowBloom = shadow bloom
    .desc = A thin violet flower that glows faintly, as if it would rather not be seen.
ent-WGCavernRimeThistle = rime thistle
    .desc = A thistle of glassy frost spines, each lit from within by a pale blue light.
ent-WGCavernNerveCluster = nerve cluster
    .desc = A knot of bare nerve tissue, swollen and pulsing with a red glow.

ent-WGCavernDigestiveAcid = digestive acid
    .desc = A pool of seething yellow-green acid. Whoever wades in is slowly digested.
ent-WGCavernTendons = dormant tendons
    .desc = Mature strands of meat choke the throat. Pushing through them is slow going.

ent-WGCavernFaunaAsclepiu = underkarst wildlife spawner
    .desc = Spawns cavern wildlife near visitors, within the planet caps.
ent-WGCavernFaunaFervidus = cinder vault wildlife spawner
    .desc = Spawns cavern wildlife near visitors, within the planet caps.
ent-WGCavernFaunaMerak = sandstone gallery wildlife spawner
    .desc = Spawns cavern wildlife near visitors, within the planet caps.
ent-WGCavernFaunaAerumna = umbral deep wildlife spawner
    .desc = Spawns cavern wildlife near visitors, within the planet caps.
ent-WGCavernFaunaThrascias = rime gallery wildlife spawner
    .desc = Spawns cavern wildlife near visitors, within the planet caps.
ent-WGCavernFaunaCarcinoma = gut biothreat spawner
    .desc = Spawns cavern wildlife near visitors, within the planet caps.
